===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|honorable|lang=en}}, {{term|honurable|lang=en}}, from the {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|honorabilis|honōrābilis|lang=la}}, from {{term|honoro|honōrō|I honour|lang=la}}; cognate with the {{etyl|it|-}} {{term|onorabile|lang=it}} and with the {{etyl|oc|-}} and {{etyl|es|-}} {{term||honorable}} [[honorable#Occitan|⁽ᵒᶜ⁾]] [[honorable#Spanish|⁽ᵉˢ⁾]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{enPR|ŏʹnərəbl}}, {{IPA|/ˈɒnəɹəbl/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/"Qn@r\@bl/}}
* {{audio|en-us-honorable.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[worthy|Worthy]] of [[respect]]; [[respectable]].

